 Ade fusses over food.","pacing":"teach","words":["salt","bowl","spoon"],"seed":1102,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":1,"drift.speed":0.07,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.7,"plane.backTiles":4},"commsBefore":[{"who":"rhee","text":"A bowl is a round, open vessel. Hold the shape in your head, then reach for it."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"ade","text":"Salt, bowl, spoon. That is just soup with extra steps. I am so proud."}]},{"id":"1-03","order":3,"title":"Home Sweet Hull","beat":"Mid: bread, home, door done. Kit asks how Rhee knows the shapes; Rhee: I wrote them down.","pacing":"core","words":["home","door","lamp"],"seed":1103,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":2,"drift.speed":0.07,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.8,"plane.backTiles":5},"commsBefore":[{"who":"rhee","text":"Home. A door. A lamp left on for someone. Easy ones, but they matter."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"kit","text":"Rhee, how do you know what each one looks like? You never look them up."},{"who":"rhee","text":"I wrote them down. Many times. Next target, please."}]},{"id":"1-04","order":4,"title":"Get Dressed","beat":"Rhee hums while she works (foreshadowing 1).","pacing":"core","words":["hat","coat","shoe"],"seed":1104,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":2,"drift.speed":0.08,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.8,"plane.backTiles":5},"commsBefore":[{"who":"ade","text":"Hat, coat, shoe. Somebody's wardrobe exploded. Please do not wear anything we catch."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"kit","text":"Is that humming? It is slow, and it keeps stopping. For science, what is the song?"},{"who":"rhee","text":"Hm. Was I humming? Habit. Keep going."}]},{"id":"1-05","order":5,"title":"Night Shift","beat":"Soft words, a gentle ramp.","pacing":"core","words":["bed","pillow","blanket"],"seed":1105,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":3,"drift.speed":0.08,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.9,"plane.backTiles":5},"commsBefore":[{"who":"rhee","text":"A blanket is a soft cover for sleeping. Longer word, same rule. Shape first."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"ade","text":"I could nap on that pillow for a week. Do not tell Rhee. She will make a schedule."}]},{"id":"1-06","order":6,"title":"Quiet Corner","beat":"Rest: a breather with small animals.","pacing":"rest","words":["cat","dog","bird"],"seed":1106,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":2,"drift.speed":0.07,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.7,"plane.backTiles":5},"commsBefore":[{"who":"kit","text":"Cat, dog, bird. A list of three, and none of them bite. I like this one."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"ade","text":"Fine, I admit it. The dog drifted past and I said hi out loud."}]},{"id":"1-07","order":7,"title":"Desk Drawer","beat":"Mid: Tomas's first half-empty message.","pacing":"core","words":["pen","book","paper"],"seed":1107,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":3,"drift.speed":0.09,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.9,"plane.backTiles":6},"commsBefore":[{"who":"rhee","text":"Pen, book, paper. These I know best. Careful, the decoys look a lot alike."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"tomas","text":"I ___ to tell ___ about the ___. It is ... quiet here. Thank you."}]},{"id":"1-08","order":8,"title":"Set the Table","beat":"Core: first four-word level.","pacing":"core","words":["table","chair","plate","knife"],"seed":1108,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":4,"drift.speed":0.1,"oxygen.drainPerSec":1.0,"plane.backTiles":6},"commsBefore":[{"who":"ade","text":"Table, chair, plate, knife. Dinner is served, and it is travelling at speed."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"kit","text":"Wait, we keep restoring things for a home nobody lives in. Who is it for?"}]},{"id":"1-09","order":9,"title":"Hallway","beat":"Core: faster drift, everyday objects.","pacing":"core","words":["window","mirror","clock"],"seed":1109,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":5,"drift.speed":0.11,"oxygen.drainPerSec":1.1,"plane.backTiles":7},"commsBefore":[{"who":"rhee","text":"Window, mirror, clock. Longer words now. Do not rush them, the clock will not."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"ade","text":"I looked in the mirror tile and it looked back. Rude."}]},{"id":"1-10","order":10,"title":"Garden Gate","beat":"Rest: green, calm, a breath before the end.","pacing":"rest","words":["garden","tree","apple"],"seed":1110,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":3,"drift.speed":0.08,"oxygen.drainPerSec":0.8,"plane.backTiles":6},"commsBefore":[{"who":"kit","text":"Garden, tree, apple. Three for the price of one orchard. Take your time."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"rhee","text":"Hm. I used to keep one of these. Never mind. Good catching."}]},{"id":"1-11","order":11,"title":"Lost and Found","beat":"Late: counterfeits appear; Rhee warns, short.","pacing":"core","words":["key","letter","phone","sign"],"seed":1111,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":6,"drift.speed":0.12,"oxygen.drainPerSec":1.2,"plane.backTiles":7},"commsBefore":[{"who":"kit","text":"Key, letter, phone, sign. Every one of them is for somebody. Let us find who."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"rhee","text":"Listen. Some tiles are counterfeits, close but wrong. Check every letter."}]},{"id":"1-12","order":12,"title":"The Crossing","beat":"Encounter: counterfeits close in. Closing: Tomas says water.","pacing":"encounter","words":["road","bridge","river","stone"],"seed":1112,"babel":true,"tuning":{"spawner.decoys":7,"drift.speed":0.14,"oxygen.drainPerSec":1.4,"plane.backTiles":8},"commsBefore":[{"who":"ade","text":"Counterfeits. Great. Ok ok ok, I am fine, I am a very calm person holding a very loud snack."}],"commsAfter":[{"who":"tomas","text":"Water. I can say water."}]}]}}
